THE BOOK — everything under book/, docs/ and research/
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Copyright (c) 2026 Oddur Sigurdsson. All rights reserved.

The prose, the outline and the distilled research notes are published here so
that readers can follow the work, file corrections and rebuild the figures.
That is not a grant of redistribution rights. You may read it, quote it with
attribution as you would any published text, and open a pull request against
it. You may not republish it in whole or in substantial part without written
permission.

This is the conservative default. If you would rather the text were openly
licensed — CC BY-SA or CC BY-NC — that is a one-line change here, and worth
making deliberately rather than by omission.

